OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'inspirational'
OL,4,Across-channel swimmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former cross-channel swimmer, who
OL,7,Finspired generations of athletes and
OL,8,Fchampioned the sport for decades, has
OL,9,Fdied aged 98.
OL,11,FEileen Fenton became just the 13th
OL,12,Fwoman to swim the English Channel in
OL,13,F1950, before going on to coach and
OL,14,Fmentor a host of athletes, some of whom
OL,15,Fhave gone on to represent their country
OL,16,Fat the Olympic Games.
OL,18,FShe was appointed MBE in 2019 in
OL,19,Frecognition of her voluntary services
OL,20,Fto long distance and competitive
OL,21,Fswimming coaching.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
